th, and more keen to save money instead.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>The oil price is dropping, </stron=
g>amid reports the US and Iran are discussing a phased deal to reopen the s=
trait of Hormuz.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Reuters</strong> reported that US =
and Iranian negotiators in New York are exploring =E2=80=9Ca phased path ou=
t of war=E2=80=9D that would involve Tehran reopening the strait of Hormuz =
and Washington lifting its economic blockade of Iran. Brent crude is down 1=
.25% today at $105.30 a barrel.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">French president <strong>Emmanuel Macron <=
/strong>is leading the fight against the US ban on US diesel exports. Macro=
